ATTRIBUTION

This project depends on, and quotes for documentation purposes, content from:

- everything8215/ff4 (MIT License) — Final Fantasy IV disassembly, used as
  the source of the 65816 assembly that this project translates.
  https://github.com/everything8215/ff4

- elzo-d/LakeSnes (MIT License) — SNES emulator core, used by the parity
  harness to execute the original ROM during shadow-execution validation.
  https://github.com/elzo-d/LakeSnes

- snesrev/zelda3 (MIT License) — Reference for the shadow-execution pattern
  applied here. No code copied, but architectural ideas (RunEmulatedFunc,
  parity verification, asm-delegated sub-routines) are adapted.
  https://github.com/snesrev/zelda3

The Final Fantasy IV ROM itself is copyright Square Enix Co., Ltd. and is
NEVER distributed with this project. Users must supply their own legally
obtained ROM (see README for required CRC32 values).
